{
 "about": "Big Type's legibility rule, answered once per approved backdrop. Baked from the mock's stress sheet (index.html#stress, BigType.bake() in the console) on 2026-11-13: each backdrop at eight moments, with the rule in tokens.js. 'ink' is the Stage's text colour in that zone: white, or dark (the console colour mixed 74% toward #0B0A18). 'veil' is the opacity of the veil behind the text, in the opposite tone, at the strongest it needed; 0.28 on the left and 0.25 in a corner are the resting values. 'changes' means the rule picked different inks at different moments, so that zone cannot be baked and needs either a fixed choice checked on the device or a live reading.",
 "caveat": "These come from the JavaScript prototypes of the backdrops, not the GLSL shaders on the device. A port that is brighter or darker than its prototype needs its row checked.",
 "zones": {
  "left": "the console name, the big name and the two lines under it",
  "topRight": "the clock and battery",
  "bottomRight": "the button hints"
 },
